{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "69b20887-3e17-892e-bd1a-44237ef2962d",
  "created_at": "2025-12-29T11:56:33-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Dominic Lombardozzi",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Priya Raman",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:51:23-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Newport Utilities billing, this is Priya. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:51:29-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, hello. Thith is Dominic Lombardozzi. Sorry, let me start over. This is Dominic Lombardozzi. I'm calling about my water and sewer bill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:51:40-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, Mr. Lombardozzi. What's going on with it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:51:44-05:00",
      "duration": 24,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me explain, and I'll go in order. Last month a crew came out and installed a new meter at my place. I'm a renter, so I didn't think much of it. They were in and out in maybe twenty minutes. Then this bill shows up, and it's a lot higher than anything I've gotten before."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:52:08-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Do you have the bill in front of you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:52:13-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I do. I have the paper bill right here in my hand."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:52:19-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. Can you read me the bill date at the top?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:52:25-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It says December ninth, twenty twenty-five. And then there's a service period listed below that, and it looks longer than usual to me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:52:36-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's helpful. A first bill after a meter swap can cover a different stretch than normal. Is there a line showing the previous reading and the current reading?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:52:49-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. The previous one says it's an estimate. And the current one says actual. So the jump is between a guess and a real number. That's what's bugging me. Nobody told me the old numbers were guesses."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:53:05-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That does happen. If the old meter was being estimated, the first actual reading can catch up on usage that was under-billed before. So the increase may not all be new usage."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:53:19-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, but I'd still like somebody to look at it. I can't tell if the new meter is right, and I'm not paying for a guess being corrected without seeing the numbers."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:53:33-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I can note the account for a review of the readings and the meter installation record. A supervisor would check whether the reading was entered correctly. Can I get the account number from the top of the bill?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:53:50-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Hold on. [pause] It's the number under the barcode, there. Four, four, one, seven, zero, eight."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:53:58-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four four one seven zero eight. Got it. And the name on the account, is that you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:54:06-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The landlord's name is on it, but I get the bill sent to me. I can give you my number for the callback."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:54:16-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Please do."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:54:18-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-nine-three."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:54:21-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-nine-three. I'll put that in the review request."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:54:26-05:00",
      "duration": 30,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Now, separate question. There's a due date on here and I don't want a late charge while this gets looked at. If I wanted to pay it today, can I do that on the website with a card? It's almost noon now, but I mean later on, say tonight after I'm home. Does it only work during office hours, or can it take a card payment right then?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:54:56-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The website payment page is generally available around the clock, so you can pay with a card in the evening or on a weekend. Only the in-person counter keeps office hours. There's also a drop box for checks outside the building."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:55:14-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so it's not like it shuts off at five."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:55:19-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, it shouldn't. Payments made online usually post by the next business day, so the date you submit it is what counts toward the due date."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:55:31-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. That's good to know. I'd rather pay the part I'm sure about, honestly, but I guess I'll see what the review says first."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:55:42-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's reasonable. I'd mention the review in your request, and a supervisor can tell you how the balance is being handled while it's open. I can't say what they'll decide, but they'll call you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:55:57-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "How long does that usually take?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:56:00-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A few business days is typical, though with the holiday week it may run a little longer. If you haven't heard by the end of next week, call back and give the account number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:56:15-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Four four one seven zero eight. I'll keep it handy."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:56:21-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Anything else I can help with today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:56:25-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. I appreciate you walking through it. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T11:56:30-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Lombardozzi. Take care."
    }
  ],
